# Record with: vhs demo.tape   (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "kubectl schema-tree deployment --expand-depth 1"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down 6
Sleep 500ms
Type "ll"
Sleep 800ms
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Tab
Type "/"
Type "maxsurge"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
